# Contact forms (Home/Shruti/Messenger "Get in touch") send email via
# EmailJS directly from the browser — no backend required. Create a free
# account at https://www.emailjs.com, then:
#
# 1. Add an Email Service connected to the inbox that should receive these
#    (sales@vihmetaverse.com) — this gives you a Service ID.
# 2. Create an Email Template with a body referencing these variables:
#    {{from_name}}, {{from_email}}, {{company_name}}, {{source}}, and set
#    its "To Email" field to sales@vihmetaverse.com (or to {{to_email}},
#    which is also sent) — this gives you a Template ID.
# 3. Copy your account's Public Key from Account > General.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local (already gitignored via the *.local pattern)
# and fill in the three values below. Without them, the forms will show an
# error instead of silently pretending to succeed.

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
